+    `${label}: ${n} sticks × 2 arms · ${RESERVED.length} reserved inks resolved per arm (${arms.light.cell.length} of them paint in a cell) · MIN_SEP ${MIN_SEP}deg · ABS_FLOOR ΔE ${ABS_FLOOR} · ratio ≥ ${RATIO_FLOOR} · MIN_DE ${MIN_DE}`,
